flowchart TD
    Alert([Security Alert]) --> Assess{Alert<br/>Type}
    
    Assess -->|Unauthorized<br/>Access| UnAuth[Unauthorized Access<br/>Attempted or Successful]
    Assess -->|Data<br/>Exfiltration| DataExf[Unusual Data Transfer<br/>Detected]
    Assess -->|Malware| Malware[Malicious Code<br/>Detected]
    Assess -->|DDoS| DDoS[Distributed Denial<br/>of Service]
    Assess -->|Injection| Injection[SQL/Code Injection<br/>Attempt]
    
    UnAuth --> BlockAccess[Block User/IP<br/>Revoke Credentials]
    BlockAccess --> InvestAccess[Investigate Access Logs<br/>& Session Data]
    InvestAccess --> DataBreach{Data<br/>Accessed?}
    
    DataExf --> IsolateSystem[Isolate Affected<br/>Systems Immediately]
    IsolateSystem --> BlockEgress[Block Egress<br/>Network Traffic]
    BlockEgress --> AssessData[Assess Data Exposure<br/>& Classification]
    
    Malware --> QuarantineSystem[Quarantine System<br/>Prevent Spread]
    QuarantineSystem --> FullScan[Full System Scan<br/>All Infrastructure]
    FullScan --> RemoveThreat[Remove Malware<br/>Rebuild If Needed]
    
    DDoS --> EnableWAF[Activate WAF Rules<br/>DDoS Protection]
    EnableWAF --> RateLimit[Aggressive Rate Limiting<br/>IP Blocking]
    RateLimit --> CloudFlare[Activate CDN<br/>DDoS Mitigation]
    
    Injection --> BlockIP[Block Source IP<br/>Immediately]
    BlockIP --> PatchVuln[Patch Vulnerability<br/>Update WAF Rules]
    PatchVuln --> ScanExploit[Scan for Exploitation<br/>Success]
    
    DataBreach -->|Yes| HighSeverity[High Severity<br/>Data Compromised]
    DataBreach -->|No| MedSeverity[Medium Severity<br/>Attempted Only]
    
    AssessData --> DataType{Data<br/>Type}
    DataType -->|PII/PHI| HighSeverity
    DataType -->|Internal| MedSeverity
    DataType -->|Public| LowSeverity[Low Severity<br/>No Sensitive Data]
    
    RemoveThreat --> MedSeverity
    CloudFlare --> LowSeverity
    ScanExploit --> ExploitSuccess{Exploit<br/>Successful?}
    ExploitSuccess -->|Yes| HighSeverity
    ExploitSuccess -->|No| LowSeverity
    
    HighSeverity --> P0[Declare P0<br/>Security Incident]
    P0 --> Legal[Contact Legal<br/>& Compliance]
    Legal --> NotifyReq{Notification<br/>Required?}
    NotifyReq -->|Yes| NotifyUsers[Notify Affected<br/>Users & Authorities]
    NotifyReq -->|No| SecurityPM
    NotifyUsers --> SecurityPM[Security Post-Mortem<br/>& Remediation]
    
    MedSeverity --> SecurityTeam[Notify Security Team<br/>Investigate Further]
    SecurityTeam --> SecurityPM
    
    LowSeverity --> Document[Document & Monitor<br/>No Immediate Action]
    Document --> SecurityPM
    
    SecurityPM --> ActionItems[Create Action Items<br/>Prevent Recurrence]
    ActionItems --> End([Incident Closed])
    
    style Alert fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style HighSeverity fill:#ff8787,stroke:#c92a2a
    style Legal fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style End fill:#90ee90,stroke:#2f9e44,color:#000
